# The renderer library and its dependencies, installed by vsce from the production tree
# (ADR 0010). Only files provably unused at runtime are left out: type declarations, source
# maps, and two OpenChemLib files: its unminified debug build, reachable only through its
# `./debug` export, and `resources.json`, read only by `Resources.registerFromNodejs` and
# `registerFromUrl`; the renderer imports and calls neither. The packaged-VSIX host test is the
# guard. vsce lets any negation win over any ignore, so the trim is written into the negation.
!node_modules/**/!(*.d.ts|*.map|*.debug.js|resources.json)
